Nested item looseness does not propagate to the outer item

```
- a
  - b

    > q
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b
        <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - b

  - c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li><p>b</p></li>
      <li><p>c</p></li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- [ ] a
  - b

    > q
.
<ul>
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled> a
    <ul>
      <li>b
        <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  b
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <p>b</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```
